// CAD.NurbsSurf — tensor-product NURBS surface point and a degree-1 ruled patch.
// Piegl & Tiller A2.1 span, A3.1 de Boor on homogeneous (x*w,y*w,z*w,w), A3.5/A4.3.
// v is blended down each u-column, then those columns are blended in u, then /w.
//
// Surface words:
//   [0] deg_u [1] deg_v [2] n_u [3] n_v
//   [4] ctrl row-major xyz, point (j,i) at ((j*n_u)+i)*3
//   [5] weights or 0, index j*n_u+i
//   [6] knots_u [7] knots_v
// Curve words: [0] degree [1] n_ctrl [2] ctrl [3] knots [4] weights or 0.
// Degree cap 8. Count cap 64. Returns 0 or -4.
//
// Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. All rights reserved.
// Licensed under the Sean Collins Software License (SCSL v1.0).

LibraryImport.Arena
LibraryImport.Cad.CAD_Num
LibraryImport.Cad.CAD_Sys

